簧振子的振动周期"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 图丙中降低环境温度, 可降低放射性元素的衰变速率"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 图丁中插入电介质, 电容器的带电量不变"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q12","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6515fe50ced8b447af158440af52fd0977130efa1716dc7172892fed6fc9440a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 如图所示是一种用于检测液面高度的光液面传感器, 由一支玻璃管和一块两面镀膜的玻璃板组成. 玻璃板插入玻璃管中央, 两者底部不接触. 检测时, 入射光从玻璃板一侧射入, 在玻璃管内壁与玻璃板之间来回发生反射并进入玻璃管底部, 然后在玻璃板另一侧反射出来. 检测出射光的强弱即可判断玻璃管外液面的高度. 已知光以相同的入射角入射到两种介质的界面上时, 介质折射率相差越大, 光在这个界面上的反射光就越强, 则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5cf14026dcc6fd7cc0667f2a3c1fb6052d5e41179594f01d39322ad372677431.png","width":235,"height":328,"width_mm":27.517,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 12 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 光在玻璃管内壁一定会发生全反射"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 光在玻璃管外壁一定不会发生全反射"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 液面高度增加时出射光强度减弱"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 液体与玻璃的折射率相差越大则传感器灵敏度越高"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"CD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q13","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["近代物理","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a3524a705d3d2550d2e0f23e36de6f4eaed140a4ec80bec8c584113b32cc6c0c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图所示, 电子和正电子以相同速率绕二者连线中点做匀速圆周运动, 形成亚稳定束缚态, 称为电子偶素. 电子偶素属于奇特原子的一种, 它没有原子核, 性质类似氢原子但更轻, 可用玻尔理论解释其特征谱线. 已知电子质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、速率 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{n}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和电子间距 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_{n}"},{"type":"text","value":" 满足量子化条件 "},{"type":"math","value":"m v_{n} r_{n} = n \\frac{h}{2\\pi} (n=1,2,3,\\cdots,h"},{"type":"text","value":" 是普朗克常量), 元电荷为 "},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":" , 电子偶素基态能量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d6afab8587b0b856ffa5f88c026b96744118c4eded72c26ddbf074a2be927130.png","width":238,"height":158,"width_mm":27.841,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 13 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 电子和正电子连线中点的电场强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{4ke}{r_{n}^{2}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 对应轨道中电子的物质波波长 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda_{n}=\\frac{2\\pi r_{n}}{n}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 对应轨道中正电子的动能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}=\\frac{n^{2} h^{2}}{8\\pi^{2} m r_{n}^{2}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 处于激发态的电子偶素向外辐射光子的最大波长 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda_{m}=\\left|\\frac{hc}{E_{1}}\\right|"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8445a377660ec7a1e004d05182e2881f2c71a85b81a11c5339a705e4b8d9a136","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题(共 14 分)\n14 - I. (7 分) 小张同学利用甲、乙两套装置分别做“探究平抛运动的特点”和“验证动量守恒定律”两个实验.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/180ebafc32165f073da40e615769bb1d19cfc4c2d6cc0fbe2b3851b8dddd70a4.png","width":265,"height":260,"width_mm":31.078,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/152458b3789b439cc6426034bb92152f6dc28557ee4c1e262b45e986f16024cc.png","width":334,"height":262,"width_mm":39.171,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n第14-I题图1\n(1)“验证动量守恒定律”实验应使用图 1 中 （填空）（选填“甲”或“乙”）装置；\n(2)关于两个实验,下列说法正确的是（填空）(多选);\nA. 悬挂重锤线的目的相同\nB. 对斜槽的光滑程度都没有要求\nC. 都需要调节斜槽使其末端切线水平\nD. 在同一次实验中都应将小球从同一位置静止释放\n(3)图2为一张已经将记录的印迹用平滑曲线连接的实验方格纸，由于操作不当造成破损，使得抛出点位置缺失.已知方格纸每个小方格边长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"4\\mathrm{mm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，请计算小球抛出时的水平速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"9.8~\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，结果保留小数点后一位）.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b139fd5129e1f082014c0b171bb2787511a7987134484c3fa72a2352d4666871.png","width":349,"height":480,"width_mm":40.951,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-I题图2\n14 - II. (7 分) 某同学测量一段长度已知的电阻丝的电阻率. 实验操作如下:\n(1)螺旋测微器如图1所示.在测量电阻丝直径时,先将电阻丝轻轻地夹在测砧与测微螺杆之间,再旋动（填空）(选填“B”或“C”),直到听见“喀喀”的声音,以保证压力适当,最后通过紧锁装置A（填空）旋转(选填“向左”或“向右”)进行锁定.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a4b31a7b4b52cd3573cde0c6c326208b74214d84194eea7dc8b5670a625571eb.png","width":326,"height":173,"width_mm":38.2,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14-row3"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c4ade03948b0cc48eabde3bed7b7644feafed4d3332f737300801aa6b6b8d86e.png","width":274,"height":151,"width_mm":32.049,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14—Ⅱ题图 1 第 14—Ⅱ题图 2\n(2)用多用电表粗测其电阻.将多用电表选择开关旋转到“×1”挡,正确操作后,指针位置如图2所示,则读数为 （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" .\n(3)图 3 中 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为待测电阻丝。请在答题纸上相应位置用笔画线代替导线，将滑动变阻器接入图 4 实物电路中的正确位置 （填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b84641039d2581cd978b5b03b346dc5f483adc5a3750b18fd78fa714da91b21a.png","width":250,"height":271,"width_mm":29.297,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14—Ⅱ题图3\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/fde13f963b4b81fb1716e8fe8ebf9d603a9427f463bc6d9fc75b22172eb244e5.png","width":323,"height":318,"width_mm":37.876,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14—Ⅱ题图4\n(4)为测量 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，利用图3所示的电路，调节滑动变阻器测得5组电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的值，作出的 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1} - I_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 关系图象如图5所示。接着，将电压表改接在 "},{"type":"math","value":"a, b"},{"type":"text","value":" 两端，测得5组电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的值，数据见下表：\n"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"math","value":"U_{2}/V"}],[{"type":"text","value":"0.50"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1.02"}],[{"type":"text","value":"1.54"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2.05"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2.55"}]],[[{"type":"math","value":"I_{2}/mA"}],[{"type":"text","value":"20.0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"40.0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"60.0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"80.0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"100.0"}]]]},{"type":"text","value":"\n请根据表中的数据,在方格纸上作出 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{2}-I_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 图象.（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/222e29701126e63d1e425ae88f845d3ebd390a117d6d123b40d80f0efcd5ea7c.png","width":410,"height":394,"width_mm":52.881,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14—Ⅱ题图5\n(5)由此,可求得电阻丝的 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" .根据电阻定律可得到电阻丝的电阻率(结果保留小数点后一位)."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14—Ⅰ.(1)乙(2分) (2)BCD(3分) (3)0.5—0.6(2分)\n解:(1)根据图片中的装置可知,乙图为“验证动量守恒定律”实验的装置,故选乙.\n(2)在“探究平抛运动的特点”实验中，悬挂重锤线的目的是保证挡板竖直，在“验证动量守恒定律”实验中，悬挂重锤线的目的是确定水平位移的初始位置，因此悬挂重锤线的目的不同，故选A错误，BCD正确.\n(3)根据实验方格纸中的平抛部分轨迹,可计算小球抛出时的水平速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"在"},{"type":"math","value":"0.5\\ m/s\\sim0.6\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"之间.\n14—Ⅱ.(1)C(1分) 向左(1分) (2)20"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) (3)见解析(1分) (4)见解析(1分) (5) 23.5(23.0～24.0都算对)(2分)\n解:(1)在测量时,为了不损坏被测物体,最后改用微调方旋钮即C,直到听见“喀喀”的响声;\n紧锁装置顺时针旋转是固定，即向左方向转动；\n(2)选择开关调节到“×1 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"”，由图2可知，金属丝的电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}=20\\times1\\ \\Omega=20\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":";\n(3) 实物图链接; 按照原理图, 将实物图连线;"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/579cd210fdfd31f6ee52c68070066611e1956b437169fdf0a2d28fa8a5bf94f4.png","width":454,"height":330,"width_mm":57.5},{"type":"text","value":"(4)作图如下所示："},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7eae1216a43c5de60ba66ffd9f9c4b064c95b138bc91edd5f54b7262410b0df4.png","width":387,"height":368,"width_mm":49},{"type":"text","value":"(5)当电压表按图3连接时，电压表测的电压为"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"的电压之和，当电压表接在a、b间时，电压表测的电压\n为"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"的电压，由图可得："},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x} + R_{0} = \\frac{1.96}{0.04}\\Omega = 49\\Omega ,R_{0} = \\frac{2.04}{0.08}\\Omega = 25.5\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x} = 23.5\\Omega ."}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q15","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a216d6e1e7b4a5ae89a31a2aa3ec87ea68da35d4cfeede42f4ea558e5c668a1e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.(8分)如图所示,水银气压计中混入了一个气泡,上升到水银柱的上方,使竖直水银柱上方不再是真空。当实际大气压相当于768 mm高的水银柱产生的压强时,这个水银气压计的示数 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{1}=750\\ mm"},{"type":"text","value":" ,此时管中的水银面到管顶的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"l_{1}=80\\ mm"},{"type":"text","value":" 。若外界气温恒定,当这个气压计的示数减小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}=740\\ mm"},{"type":"text","value":" 时\n(1)与示数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时比较,管中气体分子平均动能 （填空）(选填“增大”、“减小”或“不变”), 气体分子数密度 （填空）(选填“变大”、“变小”或“不变”);\n(2)管中气体的压强相当于多高水银柱产生的压强；\n(3) 实际的大气压相当于多高水银柱产生的压强.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3228ed26efd9d1b947a28503406a682ba78783dc7b06c99ba0225ccfb84a610c.png","width":172,"height":328,"width_mm":20.071,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.(1)分子平均动能不变，（1分）\n气体分子数密度变小；1 分）\n(2)气体压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=p_{01}-h_{1}=(768-750)\\mathrm{mmHg}=18\\mathrm{mmHg}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由玻一马定律:"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}l_{1}=p_{2}l_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n其中"},{"type":"math","value":"l_{2}=90\\ mm"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=16\\ mmHg"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=p_{02}-h_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{02}=756\\ mmHg"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q16","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"71e231f955389fe24fd0988eacfd048d88e10c036f06f4699c27de1dfd8a168e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.(11分)某研究碰撞装置的模型如图所示,它由水平直轨道AB、CD、EG与螺旋形轨道BC以及水平传送带DE无缝平滑连接而成,其中水平直轨道AB与CD的高度差h=1.2m,螺旋形轨道半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R=\\frac{4}{15\\pi}"},{"type":"text","value":" m,水平传送带DE长度L=2.4m,以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" (可调但未知)顺时针转动且动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ,除传送带外所有轨道均光滑.质量m=1kg的滑块1(视为质点)放置于水平直轨道AB上,并用弹性势能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{P}=0.5J"},{"type":"text","value":" 的弹簧锁定,质量M=3kg的滑块2放置于水平直轨道EG.现将弹簧解锁,则\n(1)滑块 1 经过 B 点时的速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(2)从 B 点下降 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{h}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，螺旋形轨道侧壁对滑块 1 的支持力 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" 大小；\n(3)若传送带速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=3\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" ，滑块1经过传送带的过程中所产生的热量Q；\n(4) 滑块 1 冲上滑块 2 后所能达到的最大高度 H 与传送带速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的关系.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d5d2d65003b529a1e2eebc63892760201199a160c8298d51528d77c808e62a87.png","width":920,"height":266,"width_mm":108.125,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16 题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的参数：重力加速度取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10 \\, \\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.(1)根据机械能守恒定律:"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{P}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{B}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B}=1\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(2)根据机械能守恒定律:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{3}mgh=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{B}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v = 3 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n根据几何关系:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin\\theta=\\frac{h/3}{2\\pi R}"},{"type":"text","value":"根据圆周运动受力:"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=m\\frac{(v\\cos\\theta)^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=\\frac{945}{64}\\pi N"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(3)根据动能定理:"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{C}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{B}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C}=5\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n根据牛顿第二定律:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu mg=ma"},{"type":"text","value":"根据匀变速直线运动规律:"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=v_{C}-at"},{"type":"text","value":"可得: t=0.4 s\n相对位移表达式:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = x_{\\text{物}} - x_{\\text{传}} = \\frac{v_{0} + v_{C}}{2} t - v_{0} t"},{"type":"text","value":"可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x = 0.4 \\, m"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n根据摩擦生热规律:"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=\\mu mg\\cdot\\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":"可得:Q=2 J (1 分)\n(4) 当"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E}^{2}-v_{C}^{2}=2\\mu gL"},{"type":"text","value":"时，滑块 1 全程减速，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E}^{2} - v_{C}^{2} = 2 (-\\mu g) L"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E} = 1 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"当"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}>7\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"时，滑块 1 全程加速，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}E-v_{C}^{2}=2\\mu gL"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E}=7\\ m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"当"},{"type":"math","value":"7\\mathrm{m / s}\\geq v_0\\geq 1\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，滑块1全达到"},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":"点的速度等于传送带速度，得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E} = v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"滑块 1 与滑块 2 的碰撞过程中，\n根据水平方向动量守恒:"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{E}=(m+M)v'"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n机械能守恒定律:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{E}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}(m+M)v'^{2}+mgH"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n即：当"},{"type":"math","value":"1\\mathrm{m / s} > v_{0} > 0"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{3}{80}\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"7 \\, m/s \\geq v_{0} \\geq 1 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{3}{80} v_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} > 7\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"H = \\frac{147}{80}\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q17","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9e768ebc359f2679b2c4078982cc674d31b93d0f592ace7790330da9716205ab","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(12分)现代科学仪器中常利用电、磁场控制带电粒子的运动,如图所示,纸面内x轴上方存在一个平行板电容器,两平行板金属CD之间的距离为d,D极板中间有一个空隙且离x轴的距离为0.2d,x轴下方有垂直纸面向里的匀强磁场,磁感应强度大小为B.现有一质量为m、电荷量为q的带正电粒子(不计重力)从极板C的中点M由静止释放,经过匀强电场加速后,穿过D极板的空隙,从P点进入匀强磁场,恰好能经过y轴上距离O点为1.2d的N点,P、O两点的距离为0.4d.求:\n(1) 匀强电场的电场强度大小；\n(2)粒子从极板中点 M 运动到 N 点的时间；\n(3)若在磁场区域增加沿 y 轴正方向的匀强电场, 大小与平行板电容器的电场强度 E 相同, 重新让粒子从 C 板中间静止释放, 经过一段时间粒子第一次到达最低点 A (图中未标\n出), 不计粒子重力, 粒子经过 A 点时速度大小和 A 点离 x 轴的距离 y.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6f7cba5a3410337eac6d11bce06db5daafac12d3e8d4a4685ca26a1f7cfe758f.png","width":311,"height":332,"width_mm":36.419,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 17 题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的参数：重力加速度取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10 \\, \\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(1)设粒子圆周运动的轨道半径为 r，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"r^{2}=\\left(r-\\frac{2}{5}d\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{6}{5}d\\right)^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得 r=2d，（1 分）\n洛伦兹力提供圆周运动的向心力，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"Bqv=\\frac{mv^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得粒子进入磁场中的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{2Bqd}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"根据动能定理则有"},{"type":"math","value":"qEd=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{2B^{2}qd}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n(2)粒子在平行板电容器中匀加速运动的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{2d}{v}=\\frac{m}{Bq}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n粒子在极板 D 到 x 轴的匀速运动时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=\\frac{0.2d}{v}=\\frac{m}{10Bq}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由几何知识可知，圆弧 PN 对应的圆心角"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\alpha = \\frac{1.2d}{2d} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha=37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n粒子在磁场中从 P 到 N 运动的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}=\\frac{\\alpha}{360^{\\circ}}T"},{"type":"text","value":"，其中"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{2\\pi m}{Bq}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n故粒子从"},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":"点运动到"},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":"点的时间为总时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t = t_{1} + t_{2} + t_{3} = \\left(\\frac{37\\pi}{180} + 1.1\\right)\\frac{m}{Bq}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3) 将粒子从 P 到 A 的过程中某时刻的速度分解为水平向右和竖直向下的分速度，分别为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}"},{"type":"text","value":"，设粒子在最低点 A 的速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，A 点离 x 轴的距离为 y，以向右为正方向，水平方向上由动量定理可得"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{1}-0 = \\sum Bqv_{y} \\cdot \\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{1}=qBy"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n由动能定理可得"},{"type":"math","value":"qEy = \\frac{1}{2} mv_1^2 -\\frac{1}{2} mv^2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = 2(\\sqrt{2}+1)\\frac{Bqd}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" （1分）\n"},{"type":"math","value":"y = (2 + 2\\sqrt{2})d"},{"type":"text","value":" （1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"850b1e010378a10c2e1c9e6a7a17eae8811b30735ae979e456037cf9539c57d5","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(13分)如图甲所示是磁力联轴器,它是一种采用非接触方式传递动力的装置,由永磁转子和导体转子组成,两者间存在间隙,不直接接触.永磁转子和电机转轴相连,导体转子输出动力.其工作原理可简化成图乙所示,永磁转子由四个形状相同的永磁体组成,这些磁体能产生辐向磁场且相邻磁场方向相反;导体转子由四个相同的、相互绝缘的单匝弧形线圈组成,这些线圈紧靠并组成半径为r的圆筒形,线圈所在处磁感应强度大小均为B.传动过程中,电机驱动永磁转子以角速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 转动.导体转子由静止开始转动,经 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":" 后达到稳定传动状态且导体转子角速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" .已知导体转子中单个线圈的质量为m,电阻为R,沿电机轴的直边长为l.若忽略所有摩擦和转子间空隙,求\n(1) 导体转子中单个线圈的感应电动势最大值；\n(2) 达到稳定传动状态后, 导体转子输出的功率;\n(3)导体转子在由静止开始转动的 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":" 内,所放出的热量.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a8991935fccd247a818f12ca6563e2594169d993ca665f805d7cb6f9be014dba.png","width":223,"height":228,"width_mm":26.06,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/198c7a13bd0c10e9884f84c0a25c22fb8bee93d79a85c72adef729fe29c1a3ad.png","width":211,"height":248,"width_mm":24.765,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q18-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/738acebd69b4091354225abdd46ea5da130dc4256812e34984c5c9e62755f8b6.png","width":257,"height":252,"width_mm":30.107,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2610-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n第18题图\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(1)导体转子中单个线圈,有两条有效直边在两个方向相反的磁场中切割磁感线,\n故感应电动势最大值大小:"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\max}=2Blr\\omega_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n(2)对于单个线圈,达到稳定传动状态后,\n受到的安培力与输出的动力大小相等,即"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{动}}=F_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n单个线圈所受安培力:"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=2B\\frac{2Blv_{\\text{相对}}}{R}l=\\frac{4B^{2}l^{2}r(\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2})}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n单个线圈输出的功率:"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{\\text{线圈}}=F_{\\text{动}}r\\omega_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n导体转子输出的功率:"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{\\text{总}}=4P_{\\text{线圈}}=\\frac{16B^{2}l^{2}r^{2}(\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2})\\omega_{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(3)对于单个线圈,根据动量定理:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum2B\\frac{2Blv_{\\text{相对}}}{R}l\\Delta t=mr\\omega_{\\text{线圈}}-0"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega_{\\text{线圈}}=\\frac{4B^{2}l^{2}}{mRr}x_{\\text{相对}}"},{"type":"text","value":"单个线圈所受安培力:"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=2B\\frac{2Blv_{\\text{相对}}}{R}l"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n磁场与线圈的相对速度:"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{相对}} = r(\\omega_1 - \\omega_{\\text{线圈}})"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n可得安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"与相对位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{相对}}"},{"type":"text","value":"的关系:"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=\\frac{-16B^{4}l^{4}}{mR^{2}}x_{\\text{相对}}+\\frac{4B^{2}l^{2}r\\omega_{1}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{相对}}=\\frac{mRr\\omega_{2}}{4B^{2}l^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{Amin}=\\frac{4B^{2}l^{2}r(\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2})}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"当"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{相对}}=0"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{Amax}=\\frac{4B^{2}l^{2}r\\omega_{1}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"根据安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"与相对位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\text{相对}}"},{"type":"text","value":"的图像可知，导体转子在由静止开始转动的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"内，磁场与单个线圈之间的一对安培力做的功为"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}-x_{\\text{相对}}"},{"type":"text","value":"图像的面积，\n即"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{\\mathrm{A}} = -\\frac{1}{2} mr^{2}\\omega_{2}(2\\omega_{1} - \\omega_{2})"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据功能关系:"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{\\text{线圈}}=-W_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n整个转子放出的热量:"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{\\text{总}}=4Q_{\\text{线圈}}=2mr^{2}\\omega_{2}(2\\omega_{1}-\\omega_{2})"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d475a0a51b69a53885818734e2f46a7a0fc11ab70eaccd778d7cf4fcc6b1382b.png","width":396,"height":244,"width_mm":50.2}]}}]}
